msgstr "Use the thumbnail sizes registered in WordPress and support regenerating them."

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-images.php:596
msgid "Auditoría de Biblioteca de Medios"
msgstr "Media library audit"

#: includes/class-taxocommerce-images.php:597
msgid ""
"Comprueba originales, metadatos y miniaturas reales. Cada lote se adapta a "
"la velocidad elegida y guarda el cursor sin perder imágenes ya revisadas."
msgstr "Checks originals, metadata and actual thumbnails. Each batch adjusts to the chosen speed and saves its cursor without losing previously reviewed images."

